"""Different decisions, genuine trade-offs, and no fabricated prompt constraints."""
from exam_common import case, p, coverage as c
G='speaking-part2'
def samples():
    return [
case(G,'farewell-gift','Chọn quà cho bạn đi Mỹ một năm','A farewell present for a year abroad','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'A friend will spend a year in the USA. Choose a farewell gift from the three options and explain your decision.',
    ['Chọn một trong ba món quà và giải thích.', 'So sánh với cả hai món còn lại.', 'Việc bạn có điện thoại hay thích chụp ảnh không có trong đề; nếu dùng thì nói rõ giả định.'],[
        p('Lựa chọn và giả định', 'For this situation, I would choose a scarf. I would assume that my friend already has a phone with a camera and will experience some cold weather during the year. If those assumptions were wrong, I might choose differently, but a scarf would be my first choice.', 'Giả định được nêu rõ, không giả vờ đề đã cho.'),
        p('Hai lý do', 'The main reason is that a scarf is both useful and personal. My friend could wear it on cool days, and I could choose a colour that she likes. It is also light and easy to pack, which matters when someone is moving abroad with limited luggage. Each time she wears it, it could remind her of home without taking up much space.', 'Tiện dụng, tình cảm và hành lý liên quan trực tiếp việc đi xa.'),
        p('So sánh hai món còn lại', 'A camera would be a lovely present for someone who enjoys photography, but a good one can be expensive and may duplicate what her phone already does. An English dictionary could help with study, but a printed dictionary adds weight, and she may prefer looking up words on her phone. I would ask about her preferences before buying anything.', 'Không nói camera hay từ điển vô dụng; nêu điểm kém phù hợp trong giả định.'),
        p('Chốt', 'For these reasons, I would buy a scarf and include a short personal message. It would be a practical gift with a connection to our friendship.', 'Kết luận về đúng một lựa chọn.')],
    [('a farewell gift','quà chia tay'),('limited luggage','hành lý có giới hạn'),('a personal message','lời nhắn riêng')],source='dthu',page=17,options=['A camera','An English dictionary','A scarf'],choice=2,
    checks=[c('Chọn khăn','choose a scarf'),c('So sánh máy ảnh','A camera would'),c('So sánh từ điển','An English dictionary could')]),
case(G,'danang-hanoi','Đi từ Đà Nẵng ra Hà Nội bằng gì?','Choosing transport for a group journey','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'A group plans to travel from Da Nang to Hanoi. Which of the three transport options would you recommend, and why?',
    ['Chọn đúng một phương tiện trong ba lựa chọn.', 'Đề không ấn định ngân sách hoặc thời gian nghỉ: trình bày giả định nếu cần.', 'Nêu lợi thế và lý do không ưu tiên hai phương tiện khác.'],[
        p('Lựa chọn', 'For this situation, I would choose a plane. The question does not give a budget or a travel schedule, so I would base my choice on a group that wants to spend more time in Hanoi and can afford suitable tickets.', 'Không tự thêm điều kiện thành thông tin có sẵn trong đề.'),
        p('Lợi thế chính', 'The main reason is that flying would reduce the time spent travelling between the two cities. Even after allowing for airport procedures and travel to the airport, it would usually leave more time for activities at the destination. It could also be less tiring than spending a long period sitting on a coach. The group could arrive with more energy to explore the city.', 'Không đưa giá vé hay giờ bay cụ thể chưa kiểm chứng.'),
        p('Cân nhắc các phương án', 'Travelling by train would let us enjoy the scenery and move around more easily. I would consider it if the journey itself were an important part of the holiday. However, it takes much longer. A coach might suit a tighter budget, but the long road journey could be uncomfortable for anyone who gets travel sick. Before booking, I would check the full airfare, including baggage, and compare it with the other options.', 'Có điểm tốt của phương án bỏ qua và điều kiện có thể đổi lựa chọn.'),
        p('Kết luận', 'Overall, a plane would be my recommendation under these assumptions. If the tickets were too expensive for some members, I would discuss taking the train instead.', 'Lựa chọn có điều kiện, không khẳng định luôn tốt nhất.')],
    [('airport procedures','thủ tục ở sân bay'),('travel sick','say tàu xe'),('including baggage','bao gồm hành lý')],source='ufls',page=16,options=['A train','A plane','A coach'],choice=1,
    checks=[c('Chọn máy bay','choose a plane'),c('So sánh tàu','Travelling by train'),c('So sánh xe khách','A coach might')]),
case(G,'birthday-venue','Chọn nơi tổ chức sinh nhật nhỏ','A rainy evening and a limited budget','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'You are planning a birthday meal for six close friends. Rain is likely, and you have a limited budget. Choose a venue from the three options and explain why it suits the group.',
    ['Bám hai điều kiện: dễ mưa và ngân sách hạn chế.', 'Chọn chỗ phù hợp sáu người, không tự đổi thành sự kiện đông người.', 'So sánh cả chi phí lẫn độ chắc chắn của kế hoạch.'],[
        p('Chọn nơi', 'For this situation, I would choose a meal at home. Six close friends would be a manageable group, and an indoor meal would not depend on good weather. It also seems the easiest option for keeping the cost under control.', 'Lựa chọn dựa trên điều kiện đề, không sở thích chung.'),
        p('Lý do và tổ chức', 'At home, I could prepare one main dish and ask friends to bring a drink or a small dessert if they wanted to help. We would have more time to talk without feeling that we needed to leave a table for other customers. I would check that there were enough seats and tell everyone in advance that the celebration would be simple.', 'Giải thích cách lựa chọn thực hiện được.'),
        p('Hai lựa chọn khác', 'A restaurant would save me cooking and cleaning, which is attractive. However, the final bill could become difficult to control, especially with drinks and service charges. A park picnic would usually be relaxed and inexpensive, but the forecast makes it risky. Carrying food to the park and then searching for shelter would spoil the evening.', 'Không khẳng định nhà hàng luôn đắt; gắn với ngân sách của đề.'),
        p('Kết', 'For these reasons, I would celebrate at home and choose food that could be prepared beforehand. The occasion would still feel special because the important part is spending time with close friends.', 'Chốt lựa chọn và một hành động thực tế.')],
    [('under control','trong tầm kiểm soát'),('service charges','phí phục vụ'),('prepared beforehand','chuẩn bị trước')],options=['A restaurant','A park picnic','A meal at home'],choice=2,
    checks=[c('Chọn ở nhà','choose a meal at home'),c('Điều kiện trời mưa','would not depend on good weather'),c('So sánh nhà hàng','A restaurant would'),c('So sánh công viên','A park picnic')]),
case(G,'exam-study-place','Chọn nơi ôn thi khi nhà đang ồn','Quiet revision with easy access to notes','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'Your exam is next week. Building work makes your home noisy during the day. You need a quiet place for two-hour study sessions and have little money to spend. Choose among the three places.',
    ['Dựa vào nhu cầu yên tĩnh, hai giờ mỗi lần và chi phí thấp.', 'Không chỉ mô tả nơi bạn thích.', 'Nêu điểm cần kiểm tra để lựa chọn dùng được.'],[
        p('Chọn nơi học', 'For this situation, I would choose the public library. I need a quiet place to concentrate for two hours, and the library is more likely to provide that without requiring me to buy anything each time.', 'Nêu tiêu chí trước ưu điểm.'),
        p('Vì sao phù hợp', 'The main reason is that a library normally has tables intended for reading and study. I could bring my notes, put my phone away and follow a clear revision plan. I would check the opening hours and whether I needed a library card before going. If seats were limited, I would arrive early rather than assume that a desk would always be available.', 'Điều kiện sử dụng không bị bỏ qua.'),
        p('So sánh', 'A café might be comfortable, but conversation and music could interrupt my concentration. Buying drinks every day would also use money I do not have to spare. A friend’s house could be free and welcoming, but my friend might have other plans or want to talk. I would not want my revision to depend on someone being available every afternoon.', 'Mỗi phương án bị loại bằng lý do riêng.'),
        p('Chốt', 'Overall, the public library offers the best match for this short period before the exam. I would prepare the material at home the night before so that I could use the study session efficiently.', 'Không nói thư viện tuyệt đối im lặng; cần kiểm tra thực tế.')],
    [('revision plan','kế hoạch ôn tập'),('opening hours','giờ mở cửa'),('concentration','sự tập trung')],options=['The public library','A café','A friend’s house'],choice=0,
    checks=[c('Chọn thư viện','choose the public library'),c('So sánh quán','A café might'),c('So sánh nhà bạn','A friend’s house')]),
case(G,'learn-cooking','Chọn cách học nấu ăn cơ bản','A beginner who needs help with technique','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'Your younger brother is moving away for college and cannot cook. He has four weekends to learn basic meals and needs someone to correct his mistakes. Recommend one of the three learning methods.',
    ['Ưu tiên người hướng dẫn sửa lỗi trực tiếp.', 'Có giới hạn bốn cuối tuần và mục tiêu món cơ bản.', 'Không chọn phương án chỉ vì rẻ khi không đáp ứng nhu cầu hỗ trợ.'],[
        p('Lựa chọn', 'For this situation, I would choose weekend lessons with a family member. My brother needs basic meals rather than professional cooking skills, and learning with someone he knows would make it easier for him to ask simple questions.', 'Chọn đúng mục tiêu của người mới học.'),
        p('Cách đáp ứng nhu cầu', 'The biggest advantage is immediate feedback. If he cuts vegetables unevenly or turns the heat too high, the person beside him can show him what to change. Over four weekends, they could practise a few meals he would actually cook at college, such as rice, eggs and vegetable soup. They could also teach him how to plan a small shopping list and store leftovers safely.', 'Bài nói minh họa hỗ trợ cụ thể, không hướng dẫn y tế.'),
        p('Đối chiếu', 'Online recipe videos would be convenient and could be replayed, but they would not notice his mistakes or answer his questions at the moment he needs help. A professional cooking course might provide good instruction, yet it could cost more and cover dishes that are too advanced for his immediate needs. I would save that option for later if he became more interested.', 'Không phủ nhận ưu điểm của phương án khác.'),
        p('Chốt', 'For these reasons, I would start with family lessons and use simple videos afterwards for revision. I would first confirm that the family member could commit to the four weekends.', 'Điều kiện người dạy sẵn thời gian được kiểm tra.')],
    [('immediate feedback','phản hồi ngay'),('store leftovers','bảo quản đồ ăn thừa'),('commit to','cam kết dành thời gian cho')],options=['Online recipe videos','Weekend lessons with a family member','A professional cooking course'],choice=1,
    checks=[c('Chọn học cùng người nhà','choose weekend lessons with a family member'),c('Sửa lỗi','immediate feedback'),c('So sánh video','Online recipe videos'),c('So sánh khóa học','A professional cooking course')]),
case(G,'company-outing','Chọn hoạt động cho nhóm đồng nghiệp','An inclusive outing for mixed fitness levels','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'Your team of twelve colleagues wants an afternoon together. Some dislike strenuous exercise, and the aim is to talk and get to know one another. Choose the most suitable activity.',
    ['Mục tiêu chính là giao lưu, không thi đấu.', 'Tính đến đồng nghiệp không thích vận động nặng.', 'Giải thích cả hai lựa chọn còn lại ít phù hợp hơn ra sao.'],[
        p('Chọn hoạt động', 'For this situation, I would choose a picnic in a nearby park. The main aim is to talk and get to know one another, and a picnic would allow colleagues to participate without needing a particular level of fitness.', 'Bám tính hòa nhập và giao lưu.'),
        p('Tổ chức phù hợp', 'We could sit in small groups, share food and include a few optional games. People who preferred a quiet conversation would not feel pressured to join a competition. I would choose a park with toilets, seating and easy transport links, then check the weather before confirming. A simple indoor backup would be useful if rain was likely.', 'Có điều kiện thực hiện; không bỏ qua thời tiết dù đề chưa ấn định.'),
        p('Đối chiếu', 'Mountain hiking would offer fresh air and attractive scenery, but it could be uncomfortable for colleagues who dislike strenuous exercise. People might focus on keeping up rather than talking. Watching a film would be relaxing and easy to organise, but we would spend most of the afternoon sitting quietly in the dark. That would not help us learn much about one another.', 'Hai lý do loại khác nhau: thể lực và ít giao tiếp.'),
        p('Kết', 'Overall, the picnic is the best fit because conversation can remain at the centre of the afternoon. I would ask about food preferences beforehand so that everyone could enjoy something.', 'Đề xuất để mọi người đều tham gia.')],
    [('level of fitness','mức thể lực'),('optional games','trò chơi tùy chọn'),('food preferences','sở thích hoặc yêu cầu ăn uống')],options=['Mountain hiking','Watching a film','A picnic in a nearby park'],choice=2,
    checks=[c('Chọn picnic','choose a picnic'),c('So sánh leo núi','Mountain hiking'),c('So sánh phim','Watching a film')]),
case(G,'small-bedroom','Chọn đồ cải thiện phòng ngủ nhỏ','Organising study materials in limited space','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'Your bedroom is small, and books and study notes are spread across the floor. You can afford only one new item. Choose the purchase that would improve your study space most.',
    ['Vấn đề chính là đồ học không có chỗ để.', 'Chọn một món, giải thích tác dụng trong phòng nhỏ.', 'Không tự thêm nhu cầu giải trí làm trọng tâm.'],[
        p('Lựa chọn', 'For this situation, I would choose a tall bookcase. The problem is not simply that the room looks plain; books and notes are taking up the floor. A bookcase would deal directly with that problem while using vertical space.', 'Ưu tiên đúng vấn đề được mô tả.'),
        p('Lý do cụ thể', 'I could organise textbooks by subject and keep loose notes in labelled folders. That would make it easier to find the material I need before each study session. Clearing the floor would also make moving around the room more comfortable. Before buying, I would measure the available space and check that the bookcase could be installed securely.', 'Giải thích cơ chế và một bước kiểm tra khả thi.'),
        p('So sánh', 'A larger desk might provide more writing space, but in a small bedroom it could make the room feel crowded. Without storage, the desk might soon be covered in the same piles of books. A decorative lamp would make the room look nicer and might improve lighting, but the question does not suggest that poor lighting is the main difficulty. It would leave the clutter largely unchanged.', 'Không chọn đèn chỉ vì mọi phòng đều cần ánh sáng.'),
        p('Kết', 'For these reasons, I would spend the money on storage first. Once the books had a proper place, I could see whether any further changes to the study area were really necessary.', 'Một quyết định rõ, không mua cả ba.')],
    [('vertical space','không gian theo chiều cao'),('labelled folders','bìa hồ sơ có nhãn'),('storage','chỗ lưu trữ')],options=['A tall bookcase','A larger desk','A decorative lamp'],choice=0,
    checks=[c('Chọn kệ','choose a tall bookcase'),c('So sánh bàn','A larger desk'),c('So sánh đèn','A decorative lamp')]),
case(G,'welcome-student','Chọn cách giúp sinh viên mới hòa nhập','A newcomer who feels nervous in large groups','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'A new international student feels lonely and is nervous in large groups. Your class wants to help the student settle in. Which of the three approaches would you choose?',
    ['Tính đến sự lo lắng khi ở nhóm đông.', 'Nêu cách giúp hòa nhập lâu hơn một lần gặp.', 'Không gán quốc tịch hoặc khả năng ngôn ngữ chưa được đề cho.'],[
        p('Chọn cách', 'For this situation, I would choose a buddy arrangement with one classmate. The student is nervous in large groups, so a single friendly contact would probably feel more manageable than meeting many people at once.', 'Không tự kết luận người nước ngoài nào cũng nhút nhát.'),
        p('Lợi ích', 'The buddy could sit with the student in class, explain everyday arrangements and invite them to have lunch. This would create repeated opportunities to talk without putting the student at the centre of attention. Over time, the buddy could introduce one or two more classmates. I would ask the student what kind of help they wanted, rather than assume that we should organise every part of their day.', 'Hỗ trợ đều và tôn trọng lựa chọn cá nhân.'),
        p('So sánh', 'A large welcome party might be enjoyable for some newcomers, but it could increase this student’s anxiety and make conversation difficult. Sending a list of university clubs would provide useful information, yet it would still leave the student to make the first contact alone. Club information could support the buddy arrangement later, once the student felt more comfortable.', 'Không chỉ loại bỏ, có thể dùng phương án phụ sau.'),
        p('Chốt', 'Overall, a buddy would offer the gentlest start and practical support over several days. I would choose someone patient and available, and check after a week whether the arrangement was helping.', 'Có cách theo dõi mức phù hợp.')],
    [('settle in','làm quen và ổn định ở nơi mới'),('a friendly contact','người quen thân thiện để liên hệ'),('at the centre of attention','ở tâm điểm chú ý')],options=['A large welcome party','A buddy arrangement with one classmate','A list of university clubs'],choice=1,
    checks=[c('Chọn bạn đồng hành','choose a buddy arrangement'),c('So sánh tiệc','A large welcome party'),c('So sánh danh sách','Sending a list')]),
case(G,'weekend-job','Chọn việc làm thêm khi có lịch học cố định','Earning money while protecting study time','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'You study from Monday to Friday and need a part-time job. You can work weekends, want reliable pay and have no vehicle. Consider the three advertised jobs and choose the best fit.',
    ['Cân nhắc lịch học, thu nhập và việc không có xe.', 'Dùng đúng thông tin quảng cáo trong các lựa chọn.', 'Không chọn chỉ vì công việc nghe thú vị.'],[
        p('Lựa chọn', 'For this situation, I would choose the weekend bookshop assistant job near my home. It fits the days when I am free, offers a fixed hourly wage and does not require me to own a vehicle.', 'Đáp ứng cùng lúc ba điều kiện.'),
        p('Lợi ích thực tế', 'The main reason is that a predictable schedule would help me protect my study time during the week. Being close to home would also reduce travel costs and make it easier to arrive on time. I could build customer service experience while knowing roughly how much I would earn each month. I would confirm the exact weekend hours before accepting, especially during exam periods.', 'Không tự hứa có thể đổi lịch; cần hỏi trước.'),
        p('So sánh công việc khác', 'The delivery job might offer flexible hours, but the advertisement requires a motorbike. Since I do not have one, renting or buying a vehicle would create an extra cost. The weekday café job would provide regular pay, but its afternoon shifts would clash with my classes. Missing lessons to work would undermine the reason I need a manageable part-time job in the first place.', 'Không bỏ qua điều kiện cứng về xe và ca làm.'),
        p('Kết', 'For these reasons, the bookshop is the most practical option. It offers a workable balance between earning money and continuing my studies, provided the employer agrees to the advertised weekend schedule.', 'Chốt có kiểm tra hợp đồng/lịch thực tế.')],
    [('fixed hourly wage','mức lương cố định theo giờ'),('predictable schedule','lịch làm có thể biết trước'),('clash with','trùng và xung đột với')],options=['Delivery rider: own motorbike required, pay per delivery','Café assistant: weekday afternoon shifts, hourly pay','Bookshop assistant: weekends, fixed hourly pay, near home'],choice=2,
    checks=[c('Chọn hiệu sách','choose the weekend bookshop assistant job'),c('So sánh giao hàng','requires a motorbike'),c('So sánh quán','clash with my classes')]),
case(G,'reduce-waste','Chọn bước giảm rác ở câu lạc bộ','A modest budget and waste from weekly meetings','choice','Chọn và so sánh giải pháp',
    'Your club meets weekly in the same room. Most of its rubbish is disposable cups and bottled water. With a small budget, choose the action that would reduce this waste most directly.',
    ['Đúng loại rác: cốc dùng một lần và chai nước.', 'Ưu tiên giảm rác tại nguồn với ngân sách nhỏ.', 'Không mặc định thùng tái chế tự làm giảm lượng rác phát sinh.'],[
        p('Lựa chọn', 'For this situation, I would choose refillable water containers and reusable cups. The club meets in the same room every week, so these items could be kept there and used repeatedly instead of being replaced after each meeting.', 'Liên hệ địa điểm cố định với khả năng dùng lại.'),
        p('Hiệu quả và điều kiện', 'This would address the main source of rubbish directly. Members could refill their own bottles, and reusable cups would be available for anyone who forgot one. I would first check that there was a suitable supply of drinking water and a place to wash and store the cups. A simple cleaning rota would make the arrangement more reliable than expecting one volunteer to do everything.', 'Không bỏ qua nước uống và vệ sinh.'),
        p('Hai lựa chọn khác', 'Buying more recycling bins could improve sorting, but it would not stop the club using new disposable cups and bottles each week. Collection arrangements would also matter. Printing environmental posters might remind people to care about waste, but a poster alone does not give them a practical alternative when they are thirsty. The message could support the change, but it should not use most of the budget.', 'Phân biệt giảm phát sinh và xử lý sau phát sinh.'),
        p('Chốt', 'Overall, I would invest in a small refill system first and explain how members should use it. We could compare the number of rubbish bags before and after a few meetings to see whether it was helping.', 'Có cách đánh giá đơn giản.')],
    [('reusable cups','cốc tái sử dụng'),('cleaning rota','lịch phân công vệ sinh'),('a practical alternative','phương án thay thế thiết thực')],options=['More recycling bins','Environmental posters','Refillable water containers and reusable cups'],choice=2,
    checks=[c('Chọn dùng lại','choose refillable water containers'),c('So sánh thùng','Buying more recycling bins'),c('So sánh áp phích','Printing environmental posters')]),
]
